# Learnova

AI-powered e-learning platform.

## Description

Learnova is an intelligent learning platform allowing users
to follow courses, complete quizzes and obtain certificates.

## Technologies

Frontend:
- React.js

Backend:
- NestJS

Database:
- PostgreSQL

ORM:
- Prisma

AI:
- Recommendation system
- Chatbot
- Quiz generation


## Architecture

Frontend → Backend API → Database

## Features

- Authentication
- Course management
- Video learning
- Quiz evaluation
- Certificates
- Gamification
- AI assistance